stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Queued: valid intent
  Queued --> Saving: trusted context and idle lane
  Saving --> Saved: acknowledged latest draft
  Saving --> Queued: newer unsent value remains
  Saving --> Failed: confirmed rejection
  Saving --> Conflict: stale revision
  Saving --> UnknownOutcome: possible commit
  Failed --> Draft: user edits
  Conflict --> Review: refresh
  UnknownOutcome --> Review: reconcile GET
  Review --> Draft: explicit new intent
